  "instructions": [
    "Cook pasta according to package instructions and set aside.",
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onions, chili peppers, and garlic to the pan and cook until the onions are translucent.",
    "Add ginger, berbere spice, salt, and black pepper to the pan and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Crack in eggs and scramble them until they are cooked through.",
